<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zen+Maru+Gothic:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Zen Maru Gothic', sans-serif; }
  </style>
  <title>iroFumi</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
  <%= csp_meta_tag %>
  <%= stylesheet_link_tag "application", "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>
  <%= javascript_importmap_tags %>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zen+Maru+Gothic:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
   body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531306728370-e2ebd9d7bb99?w=1600');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      background-attachment: fixed;
      background-color: #000014;
      font-family: 'Zen Maru Gothic', sans-serif;
    }
    .overlay {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 20, 0.55);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .app-bg { 
      display: none !important; 
      visibility: hidden !important;
      opacity: 0 !important;
      z-index: -9999 !important;
    }
    nav { display: none !important; }
    footer { display: none !important; }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0;">
  <div class="overlay">
    <h1 style="color: white; font-size: 3.75rem; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.2em; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      iroFumi
    </h1>
    <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
      今日の気持ちを、色で残す。
    </p>
    <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size: 1.275rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; line-height: 1.8;">
      つづかなくてもいい。<br>戻ってくることに、意味がある。<br><br>のこしてきた色たちが<br>あすの誰かへのてがみになる。<br>
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem;">
      <%= link_to "はじめる", new_user_registration_path,
          style: "background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); color: #333; padding: 0.75rem 2rem; border-radius: 9999px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.5rem;" %>
      <%= link_to "ログイン", new_user_session_path,
          style: "background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); color: white; padding: 0.75rem 2rem; border-radius: 9999px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>